{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/105923-tulpa-surreal-puzzle-platformer-video-game","id":105923,"title":"Tulpa (Surreal puzzle platformer video game)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-04T17:32:18-07:00","id":105923,"title":"Tulpa (Surreal puzzle platformer video game)","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> There is a project I want to share with you guys, the one that keeps me up besides OnyxPath's awesome rpgs. Its a video game I'm working on with a friend for some time now, named Tulpa (<a href=\"https://www.tulpagame.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.tulpagame.com</a>). It is a puzzle platformer game with a big dose of surrealism and small bits of occult and religious references scattered here and there.<br /> <br /> The main concept is that you control a girl and her Tulpa (also called a thoughtform), an entity created by her own will/mind in need for support while traveling through a world that becomes progressively more surreal and twisted. We think that by having the player control two characters interchangeably we were able to create some pretty interesting puzzles both from gameplay and story perspective (the game's narrative uses symbols to communicate the story though).<br /> <br /> So, please check our website and our teaser trailer here <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Syl_ZRcmlAw&amp;hd=1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Syl_ZRcmlAw&amp;hd=1</a> if you are interested in our game!<br /> And if you like it even more and want to play it, please support us by voting for our game in <a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=228461052\" target=\"_blank\">Steam Greenlight</a> or help us get the tools we need to finalize it through our <a href=\"https://www.indiegogo.com/projects/tulpa--3/x/5728595\" target=\"_blank\">crowd-funding campaign at Indiegogo</a> or just follow us on social media like <a href=\"https://twitter.com/TulpaGame\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/tulpagame\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a> and share a link with your friends.<br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks for taking time out to check Tulpa!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":405,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/405-ragecryx","user":"ragecryx","date":". 04-04-2014, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/405-ragecryx","name":"ragecryx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar405_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}